==Description==
The '''Head Torch''' is a wearable utility item that is considerably brighter than the [[Hip Lantern]] but is a directional light, only lighting in the direction the character is facing. It is equipped on the Head [[Gear]] slot. After continued use, the Head Torch will eventually break, but will not drop on death. By default, pressing {{Key|T}} will toggle the light source.

